                  thoughtCore: "You are overlooking your own preference by searching for 'the most correct' answer instead of 'the better fit'.",
                  adviceCore: "For each option, write how today would feel after choosing it. Choose the one that lets your body soften.",
                  keywords: ["Preference", "Fit", "Openness"]),
        TarotCard(id: "morning-dew", name: "Morning Dew", glyph: "❦", theme: "Renewal", primaryHex: "8CB5A4", secondaryHex: "E4F2E9",
