                  adviceCore: "Ask someone you trust what strengths they see in you. Receive the answer without arguing with it.",
                  keywords: ["Seeing", "Kindness", "Strengths"]),
        TarotCard(id: "afternoon-hourglass", name: "Afternoon Hourglass", glyph: "⌛︎", theme: "Time", primaryHex: "C1A887", secondaryHex: "F4E8D8",
                  emotionCore: "You feel time chasing you. Unfinished tasks make rest feel like a burden.",
                  thoughtCore: "You tie your worth to efficiency and forget that your existence does not need to be earned through busyness.",
                  adviceCore: "Set a timer for ten minutes and complete nothing. Notice how anxiety arrives and how it leaves.",
